Error [jet.MethodNamedCopyOrMove]: A method can't be named `copy`
  --> tests/ui/E0436_method_named_copy.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     copy: fn(self) -> Point { Point{x: self.x, y: self.y} }
    |     ^^^^
 Why: `x.copy()` is the compiler's own copy of a named value, so a method with that name would be shadowed at every call
 Fix: Rename the method and its calls, for example to `emit_copy`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0436
